{"lyrics":"[00:00.00] [Instrumental Intro]\n[00:17.14] I feel like songs should be like a ref-, like a reflection of you\n[00:21.48] Like the shit you really go through, you know?\n[00:24.48] Facts, this shit crazy\n[00:27.62] Yeah, ooh, I've been in New York for three days now, I don't wanna go home, ayy (Go home)\n[00:34.68] I was in L.A. for three weeks, yeah, I ain't wanna go home, ayy (Go home)\n[00:42.56] I be out of space on the drugs, yeah, I don't wanna go home, ayy (Go home)\n[00:48.74] I don't wanna go, I don't wanna go home (I don't wanna go home)\n[00:54.46] Heartbreak, heartbreak follows me everywhere (Follows me everywhere)\n[00:58.24] All girls the same, full of lies, never cared (Full of lies, never cared)\n[01:01.28] Never been the type to judge, life's not fair (Life's not fair)\n[01:04.90] How come when I look for love, it's not there? (It's not there)\n[01:08.34] All my mistakes, hauntin' me from the past (The past)\n[01:11.60] Fuck me over, I know it'll never last (Never last)\n[01:14.98] Every time I lose 'em, it's impossible to get 'em back (Get 'em back)\n[01:18.70] Time to throw my heart in the trash, yeah, put it in the trashcan (Trashcan), call the trash man (Trash man)\n[01:24.26] You say that I'm actin' (Actin'), does this look like an act to you?\n[01:27.96] I'm really hurtin (Hurtin'), I think you did this shit on purpose (Purpose)\n[01:32.14] The Percocets make me feel perfect (Perfect), but it's just an illusion\n[01:36.46] You got me feelin' like a burden (Burden), that's why my words keep slurrin' (Slurrin')\n[01:41.36] Eyes keep turnin' (Turnin'), and the lean keep pourin' (Pourin')\n[01:45.58] I'ma overdose in the music, since you think I'm useless (Useless)\n[01:51.18] Yeah, ooh, I've been in New York for three days now, I don't wanna go home, ayy (Go home)\n[01:58.38] I was in L.A. for three weeks, yeah, I ain't wanna go home, ayy (Go home)\n[02:05.46] I be out of space on the drugs, yeah, I don't wanna go home, ayy (Go home)\n[02:12.06] I don't wanna go, I don't wanna go home (I don't wanna go home)\n[02:17.22] I went to L.A. and I took a chance (Took a chance)\n[02:20.16] I was tryna come to L.A. just to take your hand (Take your hand)\n[02:23.50] I was really tryna be your man (Be your man)\n[02:26.38] Then you put the pain in my chest just like second hand smoke (Second hand smoke)\n[02:31.02] I'm a bad joke, right? (I'ma bad joke, right?)\n[02:32.36] Tell me why? (Tell me why, why) Why did you treat me like the bad guy?\n[02:35.42] Eyes too dry (Eyes too dry), but I still make the song cry\n[02:39.28] I'm too high to the point where I might die (Too high)\n[02:41.64] Ooh, ooh, I did everythin' to get close to you (I did everythin' to get close to you)\n[02:49.36] Just for you to push me away, just for you to push me away (Just for you to push me away, just for you to push me away, yeah you)\n[03:09.74] I held you, I loved you, just for you to push me away (I held you, I loved you, just for you to push me away)\n[03:20.40] Just for you to push me away, yeah-yeah-yeah (Just for you to push me away)\n[03:27.22] Yeah, ooh (Take me back to the chorus), I've been in New York for three days now, I don't wanna go home, ayy (Go home)\n[03:37.84] I was in L.A. for three weeks, yeah, I ain't wanna go home, ayy (Go home)\n[04:01.46] I be out of space on the drugs, yeah, I don't wanna go home, ayy (Go home)\n[04:03.28] I don't wanna go, I don't wanna go home (I don't wanna go home)","words":[[0.0,0.04,"[00:00.00]"],[0.08,0.76,"[Instrumental"],[0.88,3.88,"Intro]"],[3.9,10.32,"[00:17.14]"],[17.14,17.14,"I"],[17.24,17.34,"feel"],[17.38,17.62,"like"],[17.7,18.1,"songs"],[18.14,18.28,"should"],[18.32,18.36,"be"],[18.46,18.7,"like"],[18.74,18.74,"a"],[18.86,19.04,"ref-,"],[19.36,19.52,"like"],[19.58,19.58,"a"],[19.62,20.14,"reflection"],[20.2,20.24,"of"],[20.32,20.44,"you"],[20.46,20.68,"[00:21.48]"],[21.48,21.62,"Like"],[21.66,21.7,"the"],[21.82,22.0,"shit"],[22.08,22.14,"you"],[22.18,22.36,"really"]